<https://haopuur-max.github.io/reconnecting-dunhuang/resource/evidence/enriched> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Enriched evidence (additional authoritative source)" ;
    skos:definition "Enriched relation supported by an additional authoritative source rather than by the frozen Wikipedia revision. In this project: R16 is the project's interpretation of the International Dunhuang Project's (now International Dunhuang Programme) institutional description; R17-R19 add one documented item, the printed Diamond Sutra of 868 (British Library, Or.8210/P.2), from the IDP catalogue and research articles. Each Enriched relation points to its own sources (relation/@source, listBibl enrichment-sources) and is kept distinct from Direct evidence drawn from the frozen Wikipedia revision."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://haopuur-max.github.io/reconnecting-dunhuang/resource/concept-scheme/evidence-types> .

